{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 46, :comments ["<b>And they shall know.</b> The sense is: then they shall know that I did not bring them out of Egypt except so that they would make Me a Tabernacle and I would dwell among them. And this is \"you shall serve Elohim upon this mountain\" (above, Exodus 3:12)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:14.964092474Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}